#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:5
#: 5a3063ada58f406db6a1f8da119974ea
msgid "Interactive Rebase: cleaning up commits"
msgstr "交互式变基：整理 commit"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:9
#: 08cfd464b41e4260ba552a8544424a69
msgid ""
"This page gives a quick introduction on how to `use interactive rebase "
"<https://help.github.com/articles/about-git-rebase/>`__ to clean up commits "
"on your :ref:`cloned <git-clone>`.  This is often required before "
":ref:`submitting a pull request to the main ArduPilot repo <submitting-"
"patches-back-to-master>`."
msgstr ""
"本页简要介绍如何`使用交互式变基 <https://help.github.com/articles/about-git-rebase/>`__来整理 "
":ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` 仓库中的 commit。在 :ref:`向主 ArduPilot 仓库提交 pull request "
"<submitting-patches-back-to-master>` 之前，通常需要执行此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:12
#: a5c9b28a071b40419ed5d3c050bb3b7f
msgid ""
"These instructions give the command line instructions but the same "
"operations can be done using Git GUI editors including `SourceTree "
"<https://www.atlassian.com/blog/sourcetree/interactive-rebase-"
"sourcetree>`__."
msgstr ""
"本说明提供命令行操作步骤，同样的操作也可通过 Git GUI 编辑器完成，例如 `SourceTree "
"<https://www.atlassian.com/blog/sourcetree/interactive-rebase-"
"sourcetree>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:16
#: d3c2551509ad4fd0ad5e363a92f65996
msgid "Steps in an interactive rebase"
msgstr "交互式变基的步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:18
#: 250ec88b83134bb8943f83be5c87a437
msgid ""
"open up a terminal and cd to your :ref:`clone's <git-clone>` directory, "
"checkout the :ref:`branch <git-branch>` you wish to cleanup"
msgstr ""
"打开终端，切换到 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` 仓库的目录，检出您希望整理的 :ref:`branch <git-branch>`"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:25
#: 9db073b6af524eefbe8fe8b75374a335
msgid ""
"use the git rebase -i command with the range of commits to be modified.  For"
" example to modify any of the last 10 commits:"
msgstr "使用 git rebase -i 命令指定要修改的 commit 范围。例如，修改最近 10 个 commit 中的任意一个："

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:31
#: 1112d67e900f485fbc3a2183b9aff138
msgid ""
"in the terminal that pops up (see top image on this page) find the commits "
"you wish to modify and replace their ``pick`` with one of the following "
"letters:"
msgstr "在弹出的终端中（见本页顶部图片），找到要修改的 commit，并将其 ``pick`` 替换为以下字母之一："

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:33
#: 128187ea47934604b68ba7456fd353f4
msgid ""
"``s`` for **squash** will combine the commit with the previous commit.  In "
"the example above \"AP_HAL_F4Light: fixed some support scripts\" and "
"\"AP_HAL_F4LIGHT: small fix (NFC)\" will be \"squashed\" together into a "
"single commit"
msgstr ""
"``s`` 表示 **squash**，将该 commit 与前一个 commit 合并。在上面的示例中，「AP_HAL_F4Light: fixed "
"some support scripts」和「AP_HAL_F4LIGHT: small fix (NFC)」将被「squash」合并为一个 "
"commit"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:34
#: 5d1fb7f544de4d76a0a393907440d151
msgid ""
"``r`` for **reword** allows you to change the subject and description of the"
" commit.  Note that you cannot simply modify the subject line in the viewer."
"  First you mark it with ``r`` and later git will pop up another view to "
"allow you to modify the subject and description"
msgstr ""
"``r`` 表示 **reword**，允许修改 commit 的主题和描述。注意不能直接在查看器中修改主题行，需先标记为 ``r``，之后 git "
"会弹出另一个视图供您修改主题和描述"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:35
#: 1810eac595d1401791d4cabd7878ddad
msgid ""
"``e`` for **edit** allows you to modify what is in the commit (i.e. add or "
"take away changes)"
msgstr "``e`` 表示 **edit**，允许修改 commit 的内容（即增加或删除更改）"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:36
#: 86492d1e47b946d39b908db1c94444b6
msgid ""
"``d`` will remove the commit, alternatively you can just delete the line "
"from the viewer"
msgstr "``d`` 将删除该 commit，也可以直接从查看器中删除该行"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:37
#: 1c8e5332a8134814af2829d8721eb6c3
msgid "you may also move lines up or down to re-order the commits"
msgstr "也可以上下移动行来重新排列 commit 顺序"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:39
#: 96c63e0f95d147bf862524deeda30156
msgid ""
"save and exit the viewer.  git will run through the file from top to bottom "
"and pause when required to allow you to make the changes you have requested."
msgstr "保存并退出查看器。git 将从上到下处理文件，并在需要时暂停，以便您进行所请求的更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:41
#: 27c52e1d46e24519858058ec4a15fab3
msgid ""
"if a commit was marked with ``s`` for **squash**, another viewer will pop-up"
" to ask you to provide the commit message and subject line."
msgstr "若某个 commit 被标记为 ``s``（squash），将弹出另一个查看器要求您提供 commit 信息和主题行。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:45
#: 89e60087eba9471992fdc1089e58d15c
msgid ""
"if a commit was marked with ``e`` for **edit**, the viewer will return to "
"the regular command line. Edit the files as you wish, commit the changes and"
" then type ``git rebase --continue`` to allow git to continue processing the"
" other changes."
msgstr ""
"若某个 commit 被标记为 ``e``（edit），查看器将返回到常规命令行。按需编辑文件，提交更改，然后输入 ``git rebase "
"--continue`` 让 git 继续处理其他更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:50
#: 5d7aefaf629e408c83a789d0592f9ac1
msgid "When things go wrong"
msgstr "出现问题时"

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:52
#: 41809b7ee224497981dd2696a3a3f677
msgid ""
"If you change the order of commits or edit their contents merge conflicts "
"may occur.  If you can resolve these with a merge tool (like `TortoiseMerge "
"<https://tortoisegit.org/>`__) then you can allow the interactive rebase to "
"continue by typing:"
msgstr ""
"如果更改了 commit 顺序或编辑了内容，可能会发生合并冲突。若能使用合并工具（如 `TortoiseMerge "
"<https://tortoisegit.org/>`__）解决冲突，可输入以下命令继续交互式变基："

#: ../../source/docs/git-interactive-rebase.rst:59
#: 95f8323913f84d1a83be4ab656bceddd
msgid ""
"alternatively you may wish to abort the interactive rebase which will return"
" your branch to its original condition before the interactive rebase was "
"begun"
msgstr "或者可以中止交互式变基，这将使您的 branch 恢复到开始交互式变基之前的原始状态"
